                             Future versions
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Together with this package you can find some pictures displaying various
screens seen with LogicBBS, and you will also get a chance to see some
screenshots of future changes which will be made.

Other features that will be added in upcoming versions:

+ NetMail support internal
+ FidoNet support
+ RIP Graphics support locally (Graphics shown locally)
+ Script execution & Events started by LogicBBS at specific times.
+ Password protected messages.
+ Support of the transfer protocol : HSLINK

